 L109.90 49.47 L110.41 49.22 L110.66 49.22 Q111.29 49.22 111.66 49.47 L113.05 48.97 Q112.04 41.29 105.25 41.29 Q103.24 41.29 101.60 40.92 L100.60 41.55 Q98.46 40.92 98.46 40.16 Z M88.90 57.77 L88.90 57.52 L88.40 57.77 L86.26 57.77 Q85.76 57.77 85.25 57.52 Q82.49 57.77 80.60 58.40 L80.85 59.66 L80.60 60.16 Q81.86 61.17 82.74 63.31 Q85.25 64.19 85.25 64.56 L85.76 64.31 L89.65 65.57 Q89.78 65.07 90.16 65.07 L93.05 65.07 Q93.68 65.57 94.06 65.57 Q94.06 65.07 99.59 64.81 Q99.59 65.32 100.09 65.32 Q100.60 64.81 103.36 64.56 L105.25 65.32 Q105.25 64.31 107.26 64.31 L108.39 64.56 Q110.66 63.43 110.66 63.05 Q112.55 60.04 112.55 58.65 L112.55 57.77 Q111.04 57.77 110.66 57.02 Q110.16 57.27 109.90 57.27 L109.40 57.02 Q108.90 57.27 108.65 57.27 L108.65 57.02 L108.02 57.27 Q107.26 57.27 107.26 57.02 L105.75 57.27 L102.61 57.02 L102.11 57.27 L100.85 56.76 Q100.35 57.02 100.09 57.02 L100.09 56.76 Q99.09 57.27 88.90 57.77 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/></svg>
